  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Clauses 1-8 set the delivery obligations. Schedules A-C define prices, response windows and evidence requirements. Appendix D contains the acceptance form and Appendix E records the approved change procedure.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Navigation: scope and access (page 2); operational responsibilities (page 3); Schedule A, charges (page 4); Schedule B, service windows (page 5); Schedule C, evidence (page 6); Appendix D, acceptance (page 7); Appendix E, changes and execution (page 8).",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Controlled-copy notice",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "All organisations, contacts and operational records in this agreement are fictional. Blank signature fields are intentional. A blank field is not evidence of approval.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "1  Scope, access and delivery",
  "style": "Heading1",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Covered assets. The supplier shall monitor the listed sensors, inspect alert histories and issue one monthly service record for each site. Physical replacement of plant is excluded unless separately authorised under clause 8.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Access readiness. The client shall provide a named escort and safe access during the agreed service window. An unsuccessful visit caused by denied access is rescheduled once without a second call-out charge; the original response clock is paused only for the documented access delay.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Priority assessment. Priority is determined by operational impact, not by the number of alerts. A fire-system interface alert is escalated immediately to the client duty officer; this agreement does not replace emergency services.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Completion evidence. A job is complete only when the service record identifies the asset, arrival time, action taken and verification reading. A photograph without an asset reference is insufficient.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Definitions",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "table",
  "rows": [
    {
      "repeat_header": true,
      "cells": [
        {
          "text": "Term",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Meaning",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "repeat_header": false,
      "cells": [
        {
          "text": "Acknowledgement",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        },
        {
          "text": "A human response confirming ownership of the incident.",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "repeat_header": false,
      "cells": [
        {
          "text": "Attendance",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        },
        {
          "text": "A qualified operative reaches the nominated site reception.",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "repeat_header": false,
      "cells": [
        {
          "text": "Restoration",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        },
        {
          "text": "The asset is returned to service or a client-approved safe workaround is active.",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "repeat_header": false,
      "cells": [
        {
          "text": "Business day",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        },
        {
          "text": "Monday-Friday, excluding the public holidays stated in Schedule B.",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "repeat_header": false,
      "cells": [
        {
          "text": "Service record",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        },
        {
          "text": "One auditable record per job, including any linked follow-up visit.",
          "span": "1",
          "vertical_merge": null
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "An acknowledgement is not attendance. Meeting an acknowledgement target does not stop the attendance clock. Schedule B defines the separate targets.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Boundary example",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "If a critical alert arrives at 16:50 and the operative arrives at 18:10, attendance is 80 elapsed minutes. It is not measured from the next business day. A separate routine request received at the same time follows the routine window.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "2  Operational responsibilities",
  "style": "Heading1",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Supplier obligations",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Competence and cover. HFS shall maintain an on-call roster and provide replacement cover when an assigned operative becomes unavailable. Subcontracting does not transfer responsibility for evidence or response times.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Each operative carries a current site induction record. Remote advice may support an attendance but cannot replace an expressly required physical inspection.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Client obligations",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Site information. MCE shall maintain the access register, nominate a duty officer and disclose planned closures. The supplier must confirm receipt of a closure notice.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Known closures are listed against a site, not inferred from another site's timetable. The library and depot do not share a public-entry policy.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Joint review",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Monthly review. Both parties shall reconcile open jobs, disputed charges and repeat alerts by the fifth business day of the following month. A disputed charge is held outside the undisputed monthly amount.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "The review pack includes a list of unresolved items with named owners. Silence after circulation does not constitute acceptance of an unresolved charge.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Change control",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Authorised changes. Only the named commercial signatories may vary scope or price. An operative's service note is not a purchase order. Use the process in Appendix E before undertaking chargeable additional work.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "60",
  "numbering_level": "0",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Urgent safety action may proceed to make an asset safe, but permanent replacement still requires separate written approval. Record the boundary between the two.",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Escalation contacts",
  "style": "Heading2",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
  "drawings": 0
},
{
  "type": "paragraph",
  "text": "Client duty desk: civic-duty@example.invalidSupplier dispatcher: dispatch@example.invalidCommercial review: procurement@example.invalid",
  "style": "",
  "numbering_id": "",
  "numbering_level": "",
  "footnote_refs": [],
