         "numbering_id": "",
         "numbering_level": "",
         "footnote_refs": [],
         "drawings": 0
       },
       {
         "type": "paragraph",
         "text": "An editable working agreement for monitoring occupied public buildings, responding to equipment alerts and documenting maintenance outcomes. This issued copy incorporates the negotiated winter-access arrangements.",
         "style": "",
